## Conclusion
Applying the Principle of Least Privilege, minimizing the attack surface, and enforcing a Default Deny policy **help** protect cloud servers against unauthorized access. Understanding these core concepts provides a secure baseline for configuring the Linux server and its firewall in the upcoming stages of the laboratory activity.
